			text = [=[The Rohashi Spires float in the open sky above the {link:shrine-of-akir}Shrine of Akir{/link}, reached only by a portal from the shrine. Here {link:high-priestess-lorthuna}Lorthuna{/link} made her last stand. She had not come to break the wards, for they were already broken. She had come to light a beacon. It was answered by {link:rohash}Rohash{/link}, the Lord of the East Wind. For a moment the elves stood alone against the {link:al-akir}Windlord{/link}'s host. Then the shamans of the {link:earthen-ring}Earthen Ring{/link} and the mages of the {link:kirin-tor}Kirin Tor{/link} came through, and the spires became the place where the {link:skyborne}Skyborne{/link} first met their new allies.]=],
