			title = "The Recall Crystal",
			hint = "Bring the High Elder what the turncoat carried.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 94568 },
			},
			text = [=[The turncoat died before he could speak, but beneath his body lay a damaged recall crystal. Talaanis had {link:valennia-stormfist}Valennia{/link} wake it. Broken voices drifted out: {link:high-priestess-lorthuna}Lorthuna{/link}, speaking of the pylons and of wards that must come down. Valennia remembered that the {link:flight-from-eldre-thalas}Shal'nan{/link} had once said the pylons were wards as well as anchors, shields against whatever else dwelt in {link:skywall}Skywall{/link}. Talaanis understood at once. The cult meant to open the island to its {link:al-akir}Windlord{/link}.]=],
