				{ type = "quest", id = 92709 },
			},
			text = [=[Elaadrin told the young of his order what the keyhole had shown him. The land his people had fled was only one part of a vast world now called {link:azeroth}Azeroth{/link}. His mages had found friends there, an order much like their own. Some {link:skyborne}shen'dorei{/link}, he said, must leave {link:skywall}Skywall{/link}, recover what their ancestors had lost, and carry it home to save the island.]=],
