			text = [=[One of the last working constructs in {link:valanaar}Valanaar{/link} was found stripped of its components. The trail led to the {link:high-order}High Order{/link} magister {link:belathaan-brightwish}Belathaan Brightwish{/link}. To Ayessa, it was proof of the arrogance she had long accused the magisters of. She sent word that she would answer the High Order's threats only when its leader came to her in person.]=],
