			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Valennia Stormfist is the captain of the {link:peacekeepers}Peacekeepers{/link}, the militia of {link:zephras-isle}Zephras Isle{/link}. She keeps order in {link:valanaar}Valanaar{/link} and forbids the {link:windshapers}Windshapers{/link} and the {link:high-order}High Order{/link} to fight in her streets. She is blunt and practical. For a long time her Peacekeepers avoided open war with the cult. When that was no longer possible, she became the one who planned the war.]=],
		},
