			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Valennia stands between the island's two quarreling orders and the cult that threatens them both. She saw that the {link:windshapers}Windshapers{/link} and the {link:high-order}High Order{/link} would never unite for each other. They might unite against a greater enemy. Her plan for the assault on the {link:shrine-of-akir}Shrine of Akir{/link}, prepared long before it was needed, brought all three forces into the field together.]=],
