				{ type = "quest", id = 92640 },
			},
			text = [=[The cult ruled much of the island and believed the {link:peacekeepers}Peacekeepers{/link} beaten. Valennia meant to use that pride against it. A distraction at the front of the shrine, and a small force of Peacekeepers, {link:windshapers}Windshapers{/link} and magisters up the flank, might reach the inner sanctum and end {link:high-priestess-lorthuna}Lorthuna{/link} there. Both orders agreed. Neither forgave the other.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-inner-sanctum",
