• She sends them south to {link:constable-aonda}Constable Aonda{/link} in {link:shen-dar-village}Shen'dar Village{/link}, which the cult threatens.
• She sends others to learn the ways of the wild from a wanderer near Shen'dar.]=],
		},
		{
