			},
			text = [=[In the caves south of the grove, the ursera had grown hungry and desperate, led by a den mother the rangers called Urs'anah. Aetheen sent the youth there as a test of resolve. When the test was passed, she did not praise them for long. She sent them south, where the cult pressed on {link:shen-dar-village}Shen'dar Village{/link}, and told them to say that she had sent them.]=],
